# Project or Site Name

> One or two sentences of essential context. An agent that reads only this
> blockquote should understand what this site is and who it's for. This is the
> highest-leverage line in the file.

Optional freeform notes go here — caveats, versioning, anything an agent would
otherwise get wrong. Paragraphs and lists are fine. Headings are not: the spec
reserves H2 for the link sections below, and prose after the first H2 breaks
parsers that follow the spec.

## Docs

- [Quickstart](https://example.com/docs/quickstart.md): What it covers, in a clause
- [API reference](https://example.com/docs/api.md): Endpoints, auth, rate limits

## Product

- [Pricing](https://example.com/pricing.md): Plans and what separates them
- [About](https://example.com/about.md): Who builds this and why

## Optional

- [Changelog](https://example.com/changelog.md): Release history

